The locator core of this project (computed ARIA role calculation,
accessible-name computation, anchored light-DOM CSS path building,
the in-page capture/record panel and the recorder event wiring) was
originally developed by the same author for the SAPFX project (a SAP
test-automation ecosystem for Robot Framework, Apache-2.0) and was
ported here, generalized and stripped of all SAP/UI5-specific behaviour.
